<h1>CHAPTER 3: REQUIREMENT ANALYSIS</h1>

<h2>3.1 Functional Requirements</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>FR-1: Bus Registration:</strong> Capture vehicle registration, model, and seating capacity.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-2: Route Assignment:</strong> Assign registered buses to routes with departure times, driver IDs, and conductor IDs.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-3: Fleet Display:</strong> Show all registered buses and their active telemetry locations.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-4: Route Assignments Display:</strong> Display comprehensive tables of active route assignments.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-5: Location Updates:</strong> Enable entry or update of bus telemetry coordinates and stops.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-6: Proximity &amp; Bunching Alerts:</strong> Calculate pairwise distances between buses on the same route; trigger alerts if distance &le; 0.75 km.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-7: Conflict Prevention:</strong> Prevent duplicate registration and double-allocation of vehicles.</li>
    <li><strong>FR-8: Data Persistence:</strong> Export route assignments to CSV on system exit.</li>
</ul>

