<h1>CHAPTER 4: SYSTEM DESIGN</h1>

<h2>4.1 Overall Architecture</h2>
<p>The system architecture integrates five functional components:</p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Command Interface Tier:</strong> Unified numbered console menu providing direct access to all depot operations.</li>
    <li><strong>Fleet &amp; Schedule Manager:</strong> Controls vehicle inventory, route assignment validation, and crew pairing.</li>
    <li><strong>Spatial Telemetry Subsystem:</strong> Maintains geographic coordinates and stop progression indices.</li>
    <li><strong>Haversine Proximity Engine:</strong> Computes great-circle distances between vehicles sharing the same route.</li>
    <li><strong>Persistence Tier:</strong> Serializes records to <code>route_assignments_report.csv</code>.</li>
</ol>

<div class="code-block">
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                        BUS TRACKING AND MANAGEMENT CONSOLE                        |
|   1. Register Bus   2. Assign Route   3. Display Fleet   4. Display Assignments   |
|   5. Update Telemetry Location        6. Check Proximity Alert        0. Exit     |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                           BUS DEPOT CONTROLLER (Façade)                           |
|   - Master Bus Registry (std::map)          - Master Routes Catalog (std::map)    |
|   - Schedule Assignments (std::vector)      - Exception Validation Engine         |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                         HAVERSINE PROXIMITY ALERT ENGINE                          |
|   - Route-Based Vehicle Bucketing           - Pairwise Distance Calculation       |
|   - Spatial Threshold Comparator (0.75 km)  - Real-Time Hazard Alert Dispatcher   |
+-----------------------------------------+-----------------------------------------+
                                          |
                                          v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                               DATA PERSISTENCE LAYER                              |
|               Export to route_assignments_report.csv on Shutdown                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
</div>
<p class="caption">Figure 1: Block diagram of the system architecture</p>

<h2>4.2 Flowchart and System Workflow</h2>
<div class="code-block">
                      [ Launch Application ]
                                |
                                v
               [ Initialize Master Routes & Fleet ]
                                |
                                v
           +-----> [ Display Main Menu (0-6) ] <-----+
