<h1>CHAPTER 5: OBJECT-ORIENTED DESIGN</h1>

<h2>5.1 Identifying Classes and Objects</h2>
<p>The system is decomposed into distinct object-oriented classes:</p>
<ul>
    <li><code>Vehicle</code> (Abstract Base Class modeling generic transit vehicles)</li>
    <li><code>Bus</code> (Derived concrete class representing physical fleet buses with telemetry)</li>
    <li><code>GeoLocation</code> (Coordinate struct with spherical Haversine computation)</li>
    <li><code>Stop</code> (Waypoints along transit corridors)</li>
    <li><code>Route</code> (Ordered sequence of stops and total corridor distance)</li>
    <li><code>RouteAssignment</code> (Schedule binding of bus, route, crew, and departure timing)</li>
    <li><code>BusDepotApplication</code> (Façade controller managing application logic)</li>
</ul>

<h2>5.2 UML Class Diagram</h2>
<div class="code-block">
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                               Vehicle                                    |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| # registrationNumber: string                                             |
| # model: string                                                          |
| # capacity: int                                                          |
| # active: bool                                                           |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| + virtual displayDetails() const = 0 : void                              |
| + virtual ~Vehicle() = default                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                     ^
                                     | (Inheritance)
+------------------------------------+-------------------------------------+
|                                 Bus                                      |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| - currentLocation: GeoLocation                                           |
| - lastUpdatedStop: string                                                |
| - static totalBusesRegistered: int                                       |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| + displayDetails() const override : void                                 |
| + setLocation(GeoLocation, string) : void                                |
| + operator&lt;&lt;(ostream, Bus) : friend ostream&amp;                             |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+

+--------------------+      +--------------------+      +--------------------+
|    GeoLocation     |      |        Stop        |      |       Route        |
|--------------------|      |--------------------|      |--------------------|
| + latitude: double |      | - stopId: int      |      | - routeId: int     |
| + longitude: double|      | - stopName: string |      | - stops: vector    |
|--------------------|      | - location: GeoLoc |      |--------------------|
| + distanceTo(): dbl|      | - distFromStart:dbl|      | + addStop()        |
+--------------------+      +--------------------+      +--------------------+
          ^                           ^                           ^
          |                           | (Composition)             |
          +---------------------------+---------------------------+
                                      |
+-------------------------------------+------------------------------------+
|                         BusDepotApplication                              |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| - registeredBuses: map&lt;string, Bus&gt;                                      |
| - routes: map&lt;int, Route&gt;                                                |
| - assignments: vector&lt;RouteAssignment&gt;                                   |
| - proximityThresholdKm: double                                           |
| - static proximityAlertEvents: int                                       |
|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| + registerBus(reg, model, cap) : void                                    |
| + assignBusToRoute(...) : void                                           |
| + displayRegisteredBuses() const : void                                  |
| + displayRouteAssignments() const : void                                 |
| + updateBusLocation(reg, stop, lat, lon) : void                          |
| + checkSameRouteProximity() : void                                       |
| + exportToCSV(filename) const : void                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
</div>
