        <td><code>private: registeredBuses, routes, assignments</code></td>
        <td><code>registerBus()</code>, <code>assignBusToRoute()</code>, <code>checkSameRouteProximity()</code></td>
    </tr>
</table>

<h2>5.4 Relationships Between Classes</h2>
<p class="caption">Table 7: Class relationships</p>
<table>
    <tr>
        <th>From</th>
        <th>To</th>
        <th>Relationship</th>
        <th>Justification</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td><code>Bus</code></td>
        <td><code>Vehicle</code></td>
        <td>Inheritance (is-a)</td>
